msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Taiga「......」"
msgstr "Taiga「......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What's wrong, Taiga?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué pasa, Taiga?」"

msgid "Taiga「Let's go home.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Vámonos a casa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Glad you can walk again, above all.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Lo bueno es que ya puedes caminar.」"

msgid "Taiga「I want to go home, but I can't walk, so＿hail that taxi cab. I don't mind if you＿ride with me.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Quiero ir a casa, pero no puedo caminar,＿así que para ese taxi. No me importa＿si vienes conmigo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Th...... That's a bit of a splurge.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「E...... Eso es un pequeño derroche.」"

msgid "Taiga「So you're just going to walk home?＿Fine by me if you want to freeze your＿face off.」"
msgstr "Taiga「¿Entonces te irás caminando a＿casa? Por mí bien si quieres que＿se te congele la cara.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「What are you saying?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Qué estás diciendo?」"

msgid "Taiga「Make your choice. Take the taxi or＿walk.」"
msgstr "Taiga「Elige de una vez. Tomar＿el taxi o caminar.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Fine, fine, hold your horses...... Sheesh.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bien, bien, ten calma...... Cielos.」"
